# Public repo only

phototag on GitHub is a **generic** local vision tagging tool.

## Never commit

- Real `categories.txt` or personal tag definitions
- Server paths, mount names, host names, IPs, real NC prefixes beyond `Photos` / `example.com`
- Rule/prompt JSON used on the server (`PHOTOTAG_SANITIZE_RULES`, `PHOTOTAG_TAGGING_CUSTOM`)

## Before push

- `pytest -q`
- grep the diff for personal paths, names and tag IDs
